# Local development for `cowork-api`.
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# This Worker validates sessions by asking `sms-api`, over a private service binding in
# production. `wrangler dev` does not wire bindings between separate processes, so locally the
# binding is absent and `callSmsApi` falls back to a plain HTTP call — but only to a loopback
# origin. Point this at the running `sms-api`.
API_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:8787
